  "clips": [
    {"v":"0jFHVbBPZcE","s":123.44,"e":125.4,"line":"Uh, we don’t accept American currency, sir.","note":"Ron is in London. He wants to pay with American dollars, but the shop doesn't take them.","around":[[121.96,123.32,"I will take this."],[125.48,126.12,"Of course you do."]],"hidden":true},
    {"v":"RrhuWjTHk04","s":2677.8,"e":2679.44,"line":"I can’t accept it.","note":"A man talks about hungry children in Africa. It's not okay for him: he can't accept it.","around":[[2674.68,2677.8,"I can’t accept that the face of Africa is a hungry child."]],"hidden":true},
    {"v":"omFb-xAuGLI","s":3062.6,"e":3066.08,"line":"You don’t have to accept the invitation to every argument","note":"Don tells some advice from a friend: when people want to argue, you don't have to say yes.","around":[[3066.08,3070,"or criticism of you, and I was like, holy… you’re right."]],"hidden":true},
    {"v":"FOsmE8g5akY","s":706.56,"e":708.08,"line":"I can't accept this.","note":"Someone gets an expensive present ($100). It's too much, so they say: I can't accept this.","around":[[703.36,704.16,"$100."],[704.56,706.16,"And that's without tax."],[708.72,709.84,"But I bought it for you."],[709.84,711.28,"Well, you shouldn't have."]]},
    {"v":"UbQzZOqHPTg","s":513.36,"e":514.84,"line":"I accept the job.","note":"He says no to everything they want. Then he says yes: I accept the job.","around":[[508.48,509.92,"I reject them all."],[511.52,513.2,"Then you leave me no choice."],[514.84,515.63,"[laughter]"],[516.56,517.44,"I'm sorry."]]},
    {"v":"cV_RDvoZXwg","s":721.4,"e":722.44,"line":"Accept it.","note":"She grew up and moved on. You can't change it, so accept it.","around":[[719.64,720.4,"She grew up."],[720.4,721.4,"She moved on."],[722.44,723.68,"You accept it."],[723.76,726.32,"This town, it's all you are and it's not enough."]]},
    {"v":"728Imd_APlo","s":1306.88,"e":1310.4,"line":"So, you accept payment even though you're not a licensed tax professional.","note":"Sheldon finds out: a man takes money (payment) for tax work, but he has no license.","around":[[1301.6,1303.92,"My dad buys me a model train afterwards."],[1305.12,1305.92,"Interesting."],[1313.68,1315.92,"In clear violation of federal law."],[1317.84,1318.64,"Check."]]}
